    "text": "PISTONSCade Cunningham details recovery from collapsed lung: 'I feel great' Omari Sankofa IIDetroit Free PressApril 9, 2026, 5:12 a.m. ETSubscribe to hear this storyIt appeared Cade Cunningham was at risk of missing the rest of the regular season – at least – when he went down with a collapsed left lung more than three weeks ago.So the feelings of relief and excitement were tangible at Little Caesars Arena as Cunningham took the floor in the Detroit Pistons' final home game of the season. The superstar guard returned from an 11-game absence and mostly looked like himself in their 137-111 win over the Milwaukee Bucks in their home finale on Wednesday, April 8.",
